== Wave 1 — The Expedition (Content + Mechanics)

Wave 1 opens the door: new content and new mechanics are welcome, as long as nothing is a *pure power spike* — strength must arrive through content, mechanics, or trade-offs, never instead of them.

#pending[Wave 1 modlist — owner input required]

=== Rules for This Wave

- *Content + mechanics welcome:* new monsters, moves, equipment paths, areas, difficulty variants, or system changes that create decisions.
- *No pure power spikes:* a mod that only makes the hunter stronger — raw stat bumps, free buffs, boosted drops — with no new content, mechanic, or cost does not belong in this wave.
- Anything borderline is the owner's call; record the reasoning on the card.

